  "description": "Living a life of conformity in a group while suppressing their own desires, third-year high school student Do-young Joo meets Ye-chan Seo, an arts and physical education student, and feels a strong curiosity and attraction toward him.\n\nFeeling a sense of liberation watching Ye-chan, who seems extraordinary and free-spirited, Do-young finds that Ye-chan, despite being indifferent to others, finds Do-young’s interest in him endearing.\n\n“But how did it come to this... standing naked in front of you?”\n\n---\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10922896)",
